---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";

import Merged from "../components/Merged.astro";

import External from "../assets/external.svg";

import { Icon } from "astro-icon/components";

const title = "我在开源项目上的贡献";
---

<Layout title={title}>
  <h2>{title}</h2>
  <p>
    本人热衷于参与社区的开发工作，目前是{" "}
    <a href="https://github.com/twbs/bootstrap/" target="_blank">
      <u>bootstrap</u>&nbsp;
      <External />
    </a>
    、
    <a href="https://github.com/PCL-Community/PCL-CE/" target="_blank">
      <u>PCL-CE</u>&nbsp;
      <External />
    </a>
    、
    <a href="https://github.com/travellings-link/travellings/" target="_blank">
      <u>travellings</u>&nbsp;
      <External />
    </a>{" "}
    等的贡献者（contributor）。以下列出本人已合并的 Pull Request（PR）记录：
  </p>
  <div class="list-group">
    <a
      href="https://github.com/twbs/bootstrap/pull/43320"
      target="_blank"
      class="list-group-item list-group-item-action"
    >
      <div class="d-flex w-100 justify-content-between">
        <h5 class="mb-1">
          <Merged /> docs: fix broken Netlify logo in README
        </h5>
        <small class="text-body-secondary">
          <External />
        </small>
      </div>
      <p class="mb-1">twbs/bootstrap#43320</p>
      <small class="text-body-secondary">
        By mcenahle, merged in Nov 21, 2026, 06:35
      </small>
    </a>
    <a
      href="https://github.com/twbs/bootstrap/pull/43354"
      target="_blank"
      class="list-group-item list-group-item-action"
    >
      <div class="d-flex w-100 justify-content-between">
        <h5 class="mb-1">
          <Merged /> docs: Update the latest release of v5.x in
          docs-versions.yml
        </h5>
        <small class="text-body-secondary">
          <External />
        </small>
      </div>
      <p class="mb-1">twbs/bootstrap#43354</p>
      <small class="text-body-secondary">
        By mcenahle, merged in Nov 21, 2026, 02:41
      </small>
    </a>
    <a
      href="https://github.com/travellings-link/travellings/pull/4047"
      target="_blank"
      class="list-group-item list-group-item-action"
    >
      <div class="d-flex w-100 justify-content-between">
        <h5 class="mb-1">
          <Merged /> docs: 修正 Checkteam 指南中的标题层级 &
          toyou文档邮件超链接不正确的问题
        </h5>
        <small class="text-body-secondary">
          <External />
        </small>
      </div>
      <p class="mb-1">travellings-link/travellings#4047</p>
      <small class="text-body-secondary">
        By mcenahle, merged in Oct 24, 2026, 21:14
      </small>
    </a>
    <a
      href="https://github.com/PCL-Community/PCL-CE/pull/3639"
      target="_blank"
      class="list-group-item list-group-item-action"
    >
      <div class="d-flex w-100 justify-content-between">
        <h5 class="mb-1">
          <Merged /> docs: 完善 Minecraft
          披风名称的英文名称和中文翻译（新增极光披风、英雄披风、扭曲披风）
        </h5>
        <small class="text-body-secondary">
          <External />
        </small>
      </div>
      <p class="mb-1">PCL-Community/PCL-CE#3639</p>
      <small class="text-body-secondary">
        By mcenahle, merged in Sep 30, 2026, 20:43
      </small>
    </a>
    <a
      href="https://github.com/PCL-Community/PCL-CE/pull/3172"
      target="_blank"
      class="list-group-item list-group-item-action"
    >
      <div class="d-flex w-100 justify-content-between">
        <h5 class="mb-1">
          <Merged /> i18n(zh-CN): 完善 Minecraft
          披风名称翻译（新增工匠披风、Moonlight Trail 披风）
        </h5>
        <small class="text-body-secondary">
          <External />
        </small>
      </div>
      <p class="mb-1">PCL-Community/PCL-CE#3172</p>
      <small class="text-body-secondary">
        By mcenahle, merged in Jun 19, 2026, 10:32
      </small>
    </a>
    <a
      href="https://github.com/MHCGA/halo-cms-docs/pull/340"
      target="_blank"
      class="list-group-item list-group-item-action"
    >
      <div class="d-flex w-100 justify-content-between">
        <h5 class="mb-1">
          <Merged /> docs: 修正文档中的页面编辑入口位置描述（右上方→左下方）
        </h5>
        <small class="text-body-secondary">
          <External />
        </small>
      </div>
      <p class="mb-1">MHCGA/halo-cms-docs#340</p>
      <small class="text-body-secondary">
        By mcenahle, merged in Jun 15, 2026, 19:40
      </small>
    </a>
  </div>
</Layout>
